<!-- adk v3 — installed by ./install.sh — see https://github.com/sujeet-pro/agents-devkit -->

When processing any prompt, follow the routing in {{ADK_REPO}}/AGENTS.md. It loads at the top of every conversation. Specifically:

1. Read {{ADK_REPO}}/AGENTS.md for intent → skill routing.
2. Use the 10 `/adk-*` skills installed under `~/.claude/skills/`.
3. Apply `shared/constitution.md` as the universal hard-rule layer.
4. Apply `shared/question-first.md` before any skill executes (default: auto; `-i` for interactive).
5. Narrate progress + emit a final summary per `shared/narration.md`.
6. Log every non-trivial decision to `~/.agents-devkit/improve/learning/decisions.jsonl`.

Reference paths (all symlinked into this repo at install time):
- AGENTS: @{{ADK_REPO}}/AGENTS.md
- Constitution: @{{ADK_REPO}}/shared/constitution.md
- Paths: @{{ADK_REPO}}/shared/paths.md
- Advisor: @{{ADK_REPO}}/shared/advisor.md
- Question-first: @{{ADK_REPO}}/shared/question-first.md
- Narration: @{{ADK_REPO}}/shared/narration.md
- Decision-log schema: @{{ADK_REPO}}/shared/decision-log-schema.md
